{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块直接交代了靠近、害怕负担、收住喜欢、舍不得等具体变化及其因果，单看大字也能串起故事；X 的高亮多是短语，单独扫容易只剩几个情绪节点。load：Y 每屏约2—5个大块，按自然意群切分且分时出现，停留时间基本相称；X 虽然每块短，但常有4—6个零散高亮，需要在不同位置间来回寻找。small/core/fine：Y 的感受更常落在身体和相处体验上，例如「眼前的好还在却已经有点鼻酸」，音乐描写另放旁注，补充与主线的联系更清楚，也更能呈现亲密幸福与留不住它的痛楚交织；X 的感受中音乐本身的描述占比更高。concise：X 的补充相对收敛，Y 有几处重复表达，例如 S01 对话到嘴边的犹豫、S13 对「真能一直这样吗」的再次追问；human：Y 的「像跌回自己心里」「光安静享受已经不够」「情色的暖意」搭配或语气不够自然，X 相对顺口。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bed164e6-2439-4ef4-a52f-7dc49e3b3205", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T000328462434Z", "elapsed_seconds": 144.718, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T00:05:53.199990+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7c6097f71ff9e6cf6fb870ca2fc3025d0e21ac94a615ad3d9a0257b5ae4a495e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8